# O12 whitelist_zones.diff -- PREPARED, NOT APPLIED.
#
# Adds the six zone spells with a persistent ground visual AND a CardDB cost -- poison, graveyard,
# rage, freeze, earthquake, tornado -- to `observation.detector_cards` in both icebow/config/config.yaml
# and hogeq/config/config.yaml. Each was verified to have a detector "_aoe" ground-effect class
# (pipeline/vocab.py AOE_CLASSES) and an elixir cost (icebow/config/cards_stats.json "cards"),
# per ticket O12 section 2c. Instant spells (zap, arrows, fireball, rocket, lightning,
# barbarian_barrel, goblin_barrel, giant_snowball, royal_delivery) are deliberately excluded: they
# have no persistent visual for TeamTracker to hold a verdict on.
#
# Apply only after the estimator re-billing fix (step 2, the tombstone-style 7.6x re-bill of
# long-lived stationary tracks) is merged -- a persistent zone is exactly the kind of long-lived
# stationary track that bug re-bills every tick until that fix lands, so whitelisting these now
# would inflate the opponent-elixir estimate rather than correct it.
#
# Revert = git checkout icebow/config/config.yaml hogeq/config/config.yaml (this diff is not
# applied to the working tree; that command is a no-op today and documented here for after
# someone runs `git apply` on this file).
#
