+    #    Each has a detector "_aoe" ground-effect class (pipeline/vocab.py AOE_CLASSES) and a
+    #    CardDB cost (icebow/config/cards_stats.json); TeamTracker (O12) now bills a zone with no
+    #    own-play anchor as "enemy" so opponent_elixir.py can see these plays once whitelisted.
+    - poison
+    - graveyard
+    - rage
+    - freeze
+    - earthquake
+    - tornado
